Description: Multi-channel AI gateway with messaging integrations
 OpenClaw connects AI agents to messaging channels.
 .
 This package holds the npm release and its installer in
 /usr/share/openclaw. omarchy-install-openclaw-cli sets up a
 self-updating copy in ~/.openclaw from them. The installer brings
 its own Node.js.
